WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.070
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:06.580
Today, I'm going to explain an episode called
"Nosedive" from the British science fiction

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.269
series "Black Mirror."

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:09.269
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:11.635
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.680
The movie sets in a possible near-future scenario,
in which society is dictated by a rating system

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.939
ranging from 1 to 5 stars.

00:00:20.939 --> 00:00:25.350
In this kind of society, each individual gives
a "rating" to one another, depending on their interactions.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.640
The social and economic position that one
has in this kind of society, is determined

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.810
by that person's overall rating, there are
benefits for those with 4 and 5 overall ratings.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:40.910
On the other hand, those with 1 to 3 overall
ratings, receive little to no benefits.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:45.590
For this reason, inside this society, one
must always act positively, or else they will

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.030
get a low score.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:51.710
The episode begins with a woman jogging in
a suburban village, while holding a phone.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:56.540
The woman, Lacie Pound, is looking at her
phone, inspecting what seems to be postings

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:00.360
from other people, which she gives a rating
of 5 stars each.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:05.379
After jogging, she looks at the bathroom mirror
and practices all kinds of giggles and laughs.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:09.570
In her eyes, a faint light can be seen, indicating
some sort of technology.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:14.009
Lacie lives with her brother Ryan, who has
a lower approval rating than her, and she

00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:15.250
is eager to move out.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.810
Lacie then leaves the house to have lunch.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.590
Outside, she buys a coffee with a cookie.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:25.009
As a response, she gives the clerk and everyone
else around her a 5-star rating; everyone

00:01:25.009 --> 00:01:27.799
else in turn gives her a 5-star rating as
well.

00:01:27.799 --> 00:01:31.990
Lacie can see each person's overall rating
and information through her eyes, and other

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:37.700
people can see it as well, including her overall
rating of 4.2 stars and other information.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:42.369
She tries the cookie and coffee—which she
did not like—and takes a picture of it afterwards,

00:01:42.369 --> 00:01:45.710
which she posted online, despite her not liking
both.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:50.930
The picture receives multiple 5-star ratings,
and her overall rating goes up slightly.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.619
She goes to work after that.

00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:56.289
In the elevator, she meets a woman that she
frequently interacts with.

00:01:56.289 --> 00:02:01.450
However, the details of their conversation
are based only on each other's posts and information,

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:04.159
which they could access through their phones
and eyes.

00:02:04.159 --> 00:02:06.439
After that, Lacie goes to her table to work.

00:02:06.439 --> 00:02:10.720
There, she meets a co-worker whose overall
rating is low; her co-worker is giving off

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:13.000
free smoothies to raise his rating.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.450
Upon taking one and drinking it, she receives
low rating.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.660
She notices this and decides not to interact
with him anymore.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:24.650
Soon, she learns that her house is being bought,
so she decides to look for a new, more expensive

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.150
house to live in.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.450
She goes to "Pelican Cove" in an exclusive
neighbourhood.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:34.301
It is an expensive place, but she learns that
she needs to raise her 4.2 rating to 4.5 for

00:02:34.301 --> 00:02:36.370
a discount on this luxury apartment.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:40.690
She also learns from a consultant that she
has to socialize with people outside her circle,

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.500
particularly those of higher ratings, to raise
her ratings quickly.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:49.120
She tries at first to act friendly to all
people, but only receives average ratings.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:53.120
She then sees her co-worker with a low rating,
but he cannot enter the building this time

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.590
because his low rating does not qualify.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.820
Lacie's co-worker asks for her help, but Lacie
ignores him to preserve her rating.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:04.840
Later, Lacie uploads a photograph of Mr. Rags,
a ragdoll that she and her childhood friend made together.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:11.310
Her childhood friend, Naomi, sees this picture,
which prompted her to contact Lacie.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:15.590
Naomi informs her that she is getting married,
and she wants Lacie, her oldest friend, to

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.790
be her maid of honor, which Lacie delightedly
accepts.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:24.020
Naomi has a rating of 4.8, and has many upper-class
friends and lives on an exclusive and idealistic island.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.860
Lacie believes if she nails a perfect maid
of honour speech, she will be flooded with

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:33.740
enough 5-star ratings, to pull her approval
up to the 4.5 she needs.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:37.630
Her brother finds it strange that Naomi is
asking Lacie as her maid of honor, when their

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.740
relationship was not that great in the past.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:44.280
Lacie insists that Naomi is her friend, and
that her being the maid of honor would definitely

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.520
raise her overall rating.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:50.780
Because of this, Lacie prepares for her speech
at the upcoming wedding, even practising one

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.160
last time before leaving for the wedding.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.390
Her brother stops her, wanting her to think
about this obsession with ratings, but Lacie

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:59.190
already made up her mind.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:03.440
This leads to an argument between them, ending
in giving each other a low rating.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:07.450
On the way to the airport, Lacie receives
low ratings from two incidents, dropping her

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.820
rating from 4.2 to 4.1.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:15.180
First, she accidentally bumps into a woman
holding a cup of coffee, spilling her coffee;

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:19.370
and second, the taxi driver gives her a low
rating for being so loud while talking in

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.519
the phone.

00:04:20.519 --> 00:04:25.160
What is worse however, is that her original
flight has been cancelled, and she needs 4.2

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.910
rating to get a seat on another.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.199
She insists on taking the seat, causing a
scene that results in her overall rating going down.

00:04:32.199 --> 00:04:36.690
As a precautionary measure, the airport security
guard turns her overall rating to 3, which

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:39.090
would last for 24 hours.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:44.009
Additionally, she also receives, as punishment,
a devastating "double damage" effect on her

00:04:44.009 --> 00:04:47.889
rating, which means that all downvotes will
incur a double multiplier.

00:04:47.889 --> 00:04:51.280
Because she is going to be late to the wedding,
she decides to rent a car.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:56.340
However, she has a low rating and cannot avail
of a higher quality car, so she has no other

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:59.469
choice, but to rent a car of a much older
model.

00:04:59.469 --> 00:05:03.620
While driving, she practices her speech as
the maid of honor, but her trip is cut short

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.790
when the car needs to be charged.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:09.849
She learns that the car, being an old model,
needs an adapter to charge.

00:05:09.849 --> 00:05:14.080
Because she cannot charge it, she leaves it,
deciding instead to walk and hitchhike.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.960
Because she has a low rating of 3, cars avoid
her, but eventually, a truck stops by and

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.139
offers to help.

00:05:20.139 --> 00:05:25.050
At first, Lacie is hesitant, seeing that the
driver has a low rating, but she agrees later on.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:30.150
While driving, the truck driver, an older
woman, asks Lacie where she was going and

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:31.610
why she was going there.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.349
Lacie tells her that she is the maid of honor
in an exclusive wedding.

00:05:35.349 --> 00:05:40.129
The truck driver tells her that she was once
like her: she had an overall rating of 4.6,

00:05:40.129 --> 00:05:43.918
and she was always aiming to receive a high
rating in the belief that it will lead to a good life.

00:05:44.529 --> 00:05:49.010
However, her husband got cancer, and she did
everything for her husband, even taking him

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:54.240
to an exclusive hospital, but he was rejected
because his rating was deemed not high enough.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:58.449
After her husband died, she decided to become
honest with everything, learning in the process

00:05:58.449 --> 00:06:02.897
that her so-called "friends" did not like
her honesty that much, so she ended up having a low rating.

00:06:03.669 --> 00:06:07.669
However, she says she feels much freer without
obsessing over ratings.

00:06:07.669 --> 00:06:12.177
Lacie replies that unlike the old woman who
got nothing to lose, she still got something to live for.

00:06:13.189 --> 00:06:17.680
The trip takes all night, and in the morning,
Lacie is awakened by the truck driver, telling

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:21.389
her that they must part ways because she is
heading in another direction.

00:06:21.389 --> 00:06:26.539
As a parting gift, the truck driver informs
Lacie that she placed alcohol in her bag.

00:06:26.539 --> 00:06:30.280
Then Lacie goes to a nearby toilet and practices
her speech again.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.749
She overhears two women talking about a convention;
to Lacie's surprise, the convention is near

00:06:34.749 --> 00:06:36.500
the wedding reception.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.069
After pretending that she is heading to the
same convention, she takes a ride with some

00:06:40.069 --> 00:06:41.900
cosplayers in a van.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:47.099
Soon after, Naomi contacts her again, telling
Lacie not to go to the wedding anymore.

00:06:47.099 --> 00:06:50.960
She has heard that her overall rating had
gone down to 2, and that she cannot have someone

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.520
like that at her wedding.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.449
The only reason she invited Lacie was that
it would add her ratings exponentially.

00:06:56.449 --> 00:07:01.419
Lacie, surprised and heartbroken by this,
learns that she is just a number to Naomi;

00:07:01.419 --> 00:07:06.550
likewise, Naomi responds that she knew Lacie's
intention all along, and that is just to accumulate

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.970
high ratings in the wedding.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:12.580
In actuality, both of them never saw each
other as a friend, but rather as a tool to

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.139
gain higher ratings.

00:07:14.139 --> 00:07:18.580
However, despite this, Lacie still wants to
go to the wedding and deliver her speech,

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.400
to which Naomi responds with a stern "no."

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:26.059
This doesn’t stop Lacie; she decides to
trespass and crash the wedding reception.

00:07:26.059 --> 00:07:29.999
The cosplayers left her behind after she tells
them that she doesn't know about the convention at all.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:35.759
She drinks the alcohol that the truck driver
gave her and stops a few cars, but eventually,

00:07:35.759 --> 00:07:37.740
she sees a four-wheeler bike and borrows it.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:41.529
She finally reached the reception by sneaking
at the back, but not before falling into a

00:07:41.529 --> 00:07:43.409
swamp and getting dirty.

00:07:43.409 --> 00:07:49.099
After dressing up, Lacie—all dirty and drunk—delivers
her speech to the audience, who in response,

00:07:49.099 --> 00:07:51.020
all gave her a rating of 1.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:55.249
She reveals that she wants to be like Naomi:
someone beautiful, with high ratings, a good

00:07:55.249 --> 00:07:57.630
circle of friends, and a good life.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:01.660
She is forcefully removed from the reception
and is afterwards put in jail.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:06.240
The technology in her eyes is removed, and,
for the first time, she sees the world without

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.129
any rating of any kind.

00:08:08.129 --> 00:08:12.270
In the adjacent cell, a man is looking at
her; Lacie tries to check his information

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:17.069
out of habit, but of course, she sees nothing
as the technology has been removed from her.

00:08:17.069 --> 00:08:20.659
The man insults her, and Lacie replies with
an insult as well.

00:08:20.659 --> 00:08:24.710
Without any fear of rating, they insult each
other to their hearts' content.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:28.639
The episode ends with both of them shouting
at each other, their anger and frustration

00:08:28.639 --> 00:08:31.939
eventually turning to happiness at this newfound
freedom.

00:08:31.939 --> 00:08:35.849
